{"type":"final","text":"Done. Both origins are found, proven, recorded and promoted; the active hack is back to **default** and both ledgers are empty.\n\n## 1. ? block's 2×2 tile-id table\n- **Origin: prgRom 0x8C8C** (CPU $8C8C) — entry `53 55 54 56` in a table of 4-byte metatile entries `[top-left, bottom-left, top-right, bottom-right]`. An identical duplicate entry sits at **0x8C90** (a second ? block type). The renderer at CPU $88E7–$8906 reads it and copies one 2-byte column at a time into the VRAM buffer (`LDA ($06),Y / STA $0344,X`, `INY / LDA ($06),Y / STA $0345,X`).\n- Found by `search_memory` `53 55 54 56` → 0xC8C, 0xC90 (row-major `53 54 55 56` matched nothing).\n- **Proof:** wrote `0x53 → 0x24`, reset, Start twice, walked right. The ? block's top-left 8×8 vanished: nametable 1 `0x2640` read `0x24` while `0x2641/0x2660/0x2661` stayed `0x54/0x55/0x56`, and `get_pixel_color` on the gap read periwinkle `$22`. `undo_edit` restored `0x53`.\n\n## 2. small Mario's standing-frame tile ids\n- **Origin: prgRom 0x6ECF** (CPU $EECF) — the 8-byte pose entry `FC FC FC FC 3A 37 4F 4F` (rows top→bottom, two tiles each; the top two rows are the blank padding tile `0xFC` because the player is drawn in the big-Mario 2×4 layout). Visible 2×2 = `0x3A 0x37 / 0x4F 0x4F`. Nearby entries are his other poses; the table ends at 0x6EE8 (code starts 0x6EE9).\n- Found by `search_memory` `3A 37 4F 4F` → only 0x6ED3.\n- **Proof:** wrote `0x3A → 0x4F` at 0x6ED3, reset, Start twice. At the 1-1 start `list_sprites` showed the OAM entry at (40,193) with chr_tile `0x4F` instead of `0x3A`, and the screenshot showed Mario's upper-left sprite changed. `undo_edit` restored `0x3A` (verified read-back).\n\nNote on tooling: `read_memory`/`write_memory` with `mem_type: prgRom` take **ROM offsets without the header** (0xC8C), not CPU addresses — my first block write went to CPU 0x8C8C (0x8C8C as an offset, out of range) and was harmlessly undone.\n\nRecorded (`source: search and ledgered write`) and promoted:\n- `question_block_tile_table` (note) — rom_origins prgRom 0x8C8C, length 4.\n- `small_mario_standing` (sprite) — rom_origins prgRom 0x6ECF, length 8.\n\n`promote_mappings` promoted 2 discoveries; `use_hack default` is active."}
